# Definitions and Concept Groups

Use the [concept index](index.md) to register definitions, terminology and associated symbols against complete responsible U/C/L entries under the [definition rule](../../framework/rules/definitions.md).
Reuse adequate content in place; registration supplies navigation, not another mathematical authority.
The exact home retains objects, parameters, quantifiers, conditions or construction, domains, conventions, aliases and source symbols.
Distinguish genuinely different meanings and normalizations without creating definitions for letter substitutions or parameter instances.
Research, audit and writing follow the same [source-preparation workflow](../../framework/rules/literature.md#source-preparation).
Source inspection limits remain in U/source records, and writing arrangements remain at their actual profile or manuscript convention home.
